                "title": "Deco Octagon Knobset with Matching Rose, Omnia 201/00",
                "description": "Omnia's 201 Octagon Knobset proves that traditional style doesn't have to be simple. This Deco Octagon Knobset with Matching Rose features a unique shape that will add a point of interest to any room while still blending in well with the familiarity of traditional décor. It is available in 7 finishes in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. It covers most standard 2-1/8 inch bore hole door preparations. \r\n",
